<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Pipeline EXTENDER — Documentación</title>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#0d0e1c;--bg2:#141526;--bg3:#1a1c30;--bg4:#22253d;--bg5:#2a2e4a;
  --border:#2a2e4a;--accent:#5c7cfa;--acc2:#7c9cff;--acc3:#a5b4fc;
  --text:#dde4f5;--text2:#9aa5c8;--text3:#606882;
  --green:#43a047;--teal:#00acc1;--orange:#fb8c00;--red:#e53935;--purple:#9c27b0;
  --yellow:#f9a825;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
a{color:var(--acc2);text-decoration:none}

/* NAV */
#nav{height:52px;background:var(--bg2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 20px;gap:14px;flex-shrink:0;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100}
#nav h1{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--acc2);white-space:nowrap}
#nav h1 span{color:var(--text3);font-weight:400;font-size:12px;margin-left:6px}
.nav-tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;overflow-x:auto}
.nav-tab{padding:5px 12px;border-radius:5px;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;background:transparent;color:var(--text2);transition:all .15s;white-space:nowrap}
.nav-tab:hover{background:var(--bg4);color:var(--text)}
.nav-tab.active{background:var(--accent);color:#fff}
.nav-tab.tab-yellow{border:2px solid #f9a825;color:#f9a825}
.nav-tab.tab-yellow:hover{background:rgba(249,168,37,.15);color:#f9a825}
.nav-tab.tab-yellow.active{background:#f9a825;color:#0d0e1c;border-color:#f9a825}
.nav-tab.tab-green{border:2px solid #43a047;color:#81c784}
.nav-tab.tab-green:hover{background:rgba(67,160,71,.15);color:#81c784}
.nav-tab.tab-green.active{background:#43a047;color:#fff;border-color:#43a047}
#search{margin-left:auto;background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;color:var(--text);padding:5px 10px;font-size:12.5px;width:200px;outline:none}
#search:focus{border-color:var(--accent)}

/* LAYOUT */
#wrap{display:flex;flex:1;overflow:hidden;flex-direction:column}









#content{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:28px 32px}
#content::-webkit-scrollbar{width:7px}
#content::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--border);border-radius:4px}

/* PANELS */
.panel{display:none}.panel.active{display:block}

/* SECTION */
.sec{margin-bottom:40px;scroll-margin-top:20px}
.sec-title{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.sec-title .icon{font-size:20px}
.sec-subtitle{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--acc2);margin:20px 0 10px;padding-left:2px}

/* PROSE */
p.prose{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:10px}
p.prose code,span.code{font-family:'Consolas','Courier New',monospace;font-size:12px;background:var(--bg);color:#ffcc80;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px}

/* ARCH CARD */
.arch-row{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:20px}
.arch-card{flex:1;min-width:200px;background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:14px;position:relative}
.arch-card .arch-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--acc2);margin-bottom:6px}
.arch-card .arch-file{font-family:'Consolas','Courier New',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--text3);margin-bottom:8px}
.arch-card .arch-desc{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.5}
.arch-badge{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px}
.badge-core{background:rgba(92,124,250,.2);color:#82a0ff}
.badge-enc{background:rgba(67,160,71,.2);color:#81c784}
.badge-exp{background:rgba(0,172,193,.2);color:#4dd0e1}
.badge-corp{background:rgba(251,140,0,.2);color:#ffcc80}

/* CLASS CARD */
.cls-card{background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:12px;overflow:hidden}
.cls-card.hidden{display:none}
.cls-header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:11px 14px;cursor:pointer;user-select:none}
.cls-header:hover{background:var(--bg4)}
.cls-name{font-family:'Consolas','Courier New',monospace;font-size:14px;color:var(--acc2);font-weight:700}
.cls-kind{font-size:11px;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:600}
.kind-class{background:#1a237e;color:#90caf9}
.kind-func{background:#1b5e20;color:#a5d6a7}
.kind-dc{background:#4a148c;color:#ce93d8}
.kind-cfg{background:#e65100;color:#ffccbc}
.cls-toggle{margin-left:auto;color:var(--text3);font-size:12px;transition:transform .2s}
.cls-toggle.open{transform:rotate(180deg)}
.cls-body{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:14px;display:none}
.cls-body.open{display:block}
.cls-desc{font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:12px}
.cls-desc code{font-family:'Consolas','Courier New',monospace;font-size:12px;background:var(--bg);color:#ffcc80;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px}

/* ATTRS */
.attrs-title{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;color:var(--text3);margin-bottom:6px}
.attrs-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12.5px;margin-bottom:14px}
.attrs-table th{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text3);font-size:10.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.attrs-table td{padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text2);vertical-align:top}
.attrs-table td:first-child{font-family:'Consolas','Courier New',monospace;font-size:12px;color:#ffcc80;white-space:nowrap}
.attrs-table td:nth-child(2){color:var(--text3);font-style:italic;white-space:nowrap}
.attrs-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}

/* METHODS */
.method{margin-bottom:8px;background:var(--bg);border-left:3px solid var(--border);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:0 5px 5px 0}
.method-sig{font-family:'Consolas','Courier New',monospace;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--acc2);margin-bottom:4px;font-weight:600}
.method-desc{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.55}
.method-desc code{font-family:'Consolas','Courier New',monospace;font-size:11.5px;background:#0a0b14;color:#ffcc80;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px}
.method-tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;margin-top:5px}
.mtag{font-size:11px;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:500}
.mt-in{background:rgba(0,172,193,.15);color:#4dd0e1}
.mt-out{background:rgba(67,160,71,.15);color:#81c784}
.mt-ef{background:rgba(251,140,0,.15);color:#ffcc80}

/* PIPELINE STEPS */
.steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0}
.step{display:flex;gap:0;position:relative}
.step-num{width:36px;flex-shrink:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}
.step-circle{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;z-index:1}
.step-line{flex:1;width:2px;background:var(--border);margin:4px 0}
.step-body{flex:1;padding:0 0 20px 12px;padding-top:4px}
.step-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:4px}
.step-desc{font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.6}
.step-desc code{font-family:'Consolas','Courier New',monospace;font-size:11.5px;background:var(--bg);color:#ffcc80;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px}

/* ENCODERS GRID */
.enc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-bottom:20px}
.enc-card{background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:14px}
.enc-card .enc-name{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--acc2);margin-bottom:4px}
.enc-card .enc-class{font-family:'Consolas','Courier New',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--text3);margin-bottom:8px}
.enc-card .enc-desc{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.55}
.enc-card .enc-tag{display:inline-block;margin-top:6px;font-size:10.5px;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(67,160,71,.2);color:#81c784;font-weight:600}

/* CONFIG TABLE */
.cfg-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12.5px}
.cfg-table th{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text3);font-size:10.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.cfg-table td{padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text2);vertical-align:top}
.cfg-table td:first-child{font-family:'Consolas','Courier New',monospace;color:#ffcc80;white-space:nowrap;font-size:12px}
.cfg-table td:nth-child(2){color:var(--text3);font-style:italic;white-space:nowrap}
.cfg-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
.cfg-group{padding:6px 8px;background:var(--bg4);color:var(--acc2);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}

/* FLOW SVG */
.flow-wrap{background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:20px;overflow-x:auto}

/* SUB-TABS */
.sub-nav{display:flex;gap:4px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.sub-tab{padding:6px 14px;border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;background:transparent;color:var(--text2);transition:all .15s;white-space:nowrap;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;margin-bottom:-2px}
.sub-tab:hover{background:var(--bg4);color:var(--text)}
.sub-tab.active{background:var(--bg3);color:var(--acc2);border-bottom-color:var(--accent)}
.sub-panel{display:none}.sub-panel.active{display:block}

/* FUNC TABLE */
.func-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12.5px;margin-bottom:10px}
.func-table th{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text3);font-size:10.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;padding:5px 10px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.func-table td{padding:7px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);vertical-align:top;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.5}
.func-table td:first-child{font-family:'Consolas','Courier New',monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--acc2);white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600}
.func-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
.func-table td code{font-family:'Consolas','Courier New',monospace;font-size:11.5px;background:var(--bg);color:#ffcc80;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px}
.func-row-header{background:var(--bg4)}
.func-row-header td{color:var(--text3);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;padding:4px 10px}

/* CHIPS */
.chip{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;margin:2px;background:var(--bg4);color:var(--text2)}
.chip.accent{background:rgba(92,124,250,.2);color:var(--acc2)}

/* ALERT */
.alert{background:rgba(92,124,250,.1);border:1px solid rgba(92,124,250,.3);border-radius:7px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.6}
.alert code{font-family:'Consolas','Courier New',monospace;font-size:12px;background:var(--bg);color:#ffcc80;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px}

.no-results{display:none;text-align:center;padding:60px;color:var(--text3);font-size:14px}

/* SPLIT PANE (core panel) */
#content{position:relative}
#panel-core.active{display:flex;flex-direction:row;overflow:hidden;margin:-28px -32px;height:calc(100vh - 52px)}
#core-code-pane{width:44%;min-width:200px;background:#0a0b14;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;flex-shrink:0}
#core-code-pre{margin:0;padding:8px 0;flex:1;overflow-y:auto;overflow-x:auto;font-family:"Consolas","Courier New",monospace;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;counter-reset:lc}
#core-code-pre .cl{display:block;padding:0 12px 0 50px;position:relative;white-space:pre;tab-size:4;min-height:1.55em}
#core-code-pre .cl::before{content:counter(lc);counter-increment:lc;position:absolute;left:0;width:40px;text-align:right;color:#3d4451;padding-right:8px;user-select:none;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.55;top:0}
#core-code-pre .cl.hl-section{background:rgba(92,124,250,.13);border-left:2px solid var(--accent)}
#core-code-pre .cl.hl-section::before{color:#5c7cfa}
#core-divider{width:5px;background:var(--border);cursor:col-resize;flex-shrink:0;transition:background .15s}
#core-divider:hover,#core-divider.dragging{background:var(--accent)}
#core-code-file{background:#0a0b14;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:6px 10px;font-size:11px;font-family:"Consolas","Courier New",monospace;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;flex-shrink:0}
#core-code-file span:first-child{color:var(--acc2);font-weight:600}
#core-doc-pane{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:24px 28px;min-width:300px}
.py-kw{color:#ff7b72}.py-str{color:#a5d6a7}.py-cmt{color:#6e7681;font-style:italic}
.py-dec{color:#d2a8ff}.py-fn{color:#79c0ff}.py-cls{color:#ffa657}.py-num{color:#f0883e}
.py-bi{color:#e3b341}

.pal-btn{background:transparent;border:1px solid #3d4451;color:#8b949e;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;line-height:1;margin-left:3px;transition:all .15s}
.pal-btn:hover{border-color:#79c0ff;color:#79c0ff}
.pal-btn.active{background:#1c2a3a;border-color:#79c0ff;color:#79c0ff}

/* ── GENERIC SPLIT PANELS ── */
.split-code-pane{width:44%;min-width:180px;background:#0a0b14;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;flex-shrink:0}
.split-code-pre{margin:0;padding:8px 0;flex:1;overflow-y:auto;overflow-x:auto;font-family:"Consolas","Courier New",monospace;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;counter-reset:lc}
.split-code-pre .cl{display:block;padding:0 12px 0 50px;position:relative;white-space:pre;tab-size:4;min-height:1.55em}
.split-code-pre .cl::before{content:counter(lc);counter-increment:lc;position:absolute;left:0;width:40px;text-align:right;color:#3d4451;padding-right:8px;user-select:none;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.55;top:0}
.split-code-pre .cl.hl-section{background:rgba(92,124,250,.13);border-left:2px solid var(--accent)}
.split-code-pre .cl.hl-section::before{color:#5c7cfa}
.split-divider{width:5px;background:var(--border);cursor:col-resize;flex-shrink:0;transition:background .15s}
.split-divider:hover,.split-divider.dragging{background:var(--accent)}
.split-code-file{background:#0a0b14;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:6px 10px;font-size:11px;font-family:"Consolas","Courier New",monospace;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;flex-shrink:0}
.split-doc-pane{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:24px 28px;min-width:300px}
#panel-encoders.active,#panel-explorer.active,#panel-corpus.active{display:flex;flex-direction:row;overflow:hidden;margin:-28px -32px;height:calc(100vh - 52px)}
.file-btn{background:transparent;border:1px solid #3d4451;color:#8b949e;font-size:10.5px;padding:1px 7px;border-radius:3px;cursor:pointer;margin-left:4px}
.file-btn:hover{border-color:#79c0ff;color:#79c0ff}
.file-btn.active{background:#1c2a3a;border-color:#79c0ff;color:#79c0ff}

/* ── GENERIC SPLIT PANELS ── */
.split-code-pane{width:44%;min-width:180px;background:#0a0b14;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;flex-shrink:0}
.split-code-pre{margin:0;padding:8px 0;flex:1;overflow-y:auto;overflow-x:auto;font-family:"Consolas","Courier New",monospace;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;counter-reset:lc}
.split-code-pre .cl{display:block;padding:0 12px 0 50px;position:relative;white-space:pre;tab-size:4;min-height:1.55em}
.split-code-pre .cl::before{content:counter(lc);counter-increment:lc;position:absolute;left:0;width:40px;text-align:right;color:#3d4451;padding-right:8px;user-select:none;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.55;top:0}
.split-code-pre .cl.hl-section{background:rgba(92,124,250,.13);border-left:2px solid var(--accent)}
.split-code-pre .cl.hl-section::before{color:#5c7cfa}
.split-divider{width:5px;background:var(--border);cursor:col-resize;flex-shrink:0;transition:background .15s}
.split-divider:hover,.split-divider.dragging{background:var(--accent)}
.split-code-file{background:#0a0b14;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:6px 10px;font-size:11px;font-family:"Consolas","Courier New",monospace;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;flex-shrink:0}
.split-doc-pane{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:24px 28px;min-width:300px}
#panel-encoders.active,#panel-explorer.active,#panel-corpus.active{display:flex;flex-direction:row;overflow:hidden;margin:-28px -32px;height:calc(100vh - 52px)}


/* ── GENERIC SPLIT PANELS ── */
.split-code-pane{width:44%;min-width:180px;background:#0a0b14;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;flex-shrink:0}
.split-code-pre{margin:0;padding:8px 0;flex:1;overflow-y:auto;overflow-x:auto;font-family:"Consolas","Courier New",monospace;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;counter-reset:lc}
.split-code-pre .cl{display:block;padding:0 12px 0 50px;position:relative;white-space:pre;tab-size:4;min-height:1.55em}
.split-code-pre .cl::before{content:counter(lc);counter-increment:lc;position:absolute;left:0;width:40px;text-align:right;color:#3d4451;padding-right:8px;user-select:none;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.55;top:0}
.split-code-pre .cl.hl-section{background:rgba(92,124,250,.13);border-left:2px solid var(--accent)}
.split-code-pre .cl.hl-section::before{color:#5c7cfa}
.split-divider{width:5px;background:var(--border);cursor:col-resize;flex-shrink:0;transition:background .15s}
.split-divider:hover,.split-divider.dragging{background:var(--accent)}
.split-code-file{background:#0a0b14;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:6px 10px;font-size:11px;font-family:"Consolas","Courier New",monospace;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;flex-shrink:0}
.split-doc-pane{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:24px 28px;min-width:300px}
#panel-encoders.active,#panel-explorer.active,#panel-corpus.active{display:flex;flex-direction:row;overflow:hidden;margin:-28px -32px;height:calc(100vh - 52px)}
.file-btn{background:transparent;border:1px solid #3d4451;color:#8b949e;font-size:10.5px;padding:1px 7px;border-radius:3px;cursor:pointer;margin-left:4px}
.file-btn:hover{border-color:#79c0ff;color:#79c0ff}
.file-btn.active{background:#1c2a3a;border-color:#79c0ff;color:#79c0ff}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="nav">
  <h1>🧠 EXTENDER <span>Pipeline Documentation</span></h1>
  <div class="nav-tabs">
    <button class="nav-tab tab-yellow active" onclick="showTab('overview',this)">Arquitectura</button>
    <button class="nav-tab tab-green" onclick="showTab('core',this)">extender_bertopic</button>
    <button class="nav-tab tab-green" onclick="showTab('encoders',this)">Encoders</button>
    <button class="nav-tab tab-green" onclick="showTab('explorer',this)">TopicExplorer</button>
    <button class="nav-tab tab-green" onclick="showTab('corpus',this)">Corpus</button>
  </div>
  <input id="search" type="text" placeholder="🔍 Buscar…" oninput="doSearch(this.value)">
</div>

<div id="wrap">

<div id="content">
<div class="no-results" id="no-results">Sin resultados para "<span id="nq"></span>"</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     PANEL: ARQUITECTURA
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="panel active" id="panel-overview">

<div class="sec" id="ov-intro">
  <div class="sec-title"><span class="icon">🗺️</span> Visión general</div>

  <div class="alert">
    El pipeline activo es <strong>TopicExplorer</strong>: descubrimiento de tópicos en una sola pasada sobre un corpus estático (Curlie). <code>extender_bertopic.py</code> ahora solo expone los bloques base compartidos: <code>ConceptMap</code>, <code>EmbeddingEngine</code>, <code>tokenise</code> y utilidades de texto. El pipeline iterativo basado en búsqueda web fue eliminado.
  </div>

  <div class="arch-row">
    <div class="arch-card">
      <div class="arch-title">extender_bertopic.py</div>
      <div class="arch-file">📄 ~530 líneas</div>
      <div class="arch-desc">Bloques base del pipeline: <strong>ConceptNode</strong> + <strong>ConceptMap</strong> (grafo del mapa), <strong>EmbeddingEngine</strong> (SBERT, 384 dim), y utilidades de texto (<code>tokenise</code>, <code>clean_text</code>, <code>_DOMAIN_SEEDS</code>). El pipeline iterativo de búsqueda web fue eliminado.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="arch-card">
      <div class="arch-badge badge-enc">Encoders</div>
      <div class="arch-title">concept_map_encoder.py</div>
      <div class="arch-file">📄 ~750 líneas</div>
      <div class="arch-desc">4 estrategias para convertir un mapa conceptual en vectores de búsqueda: <strong>ConceptMapEncoder</strong> (nodos), <strong>RelationAwareEncoder</strong> (tripletas), <strong>PathAwareEncoder</strong> (caminos), <strong>HybridEncoder</strong> (híbrido adaptativo por profundidad).</div>
    </div>
    <div class="arch-card">
      <div class="arch-badge badge-exp">Pipeline principal (app)</div>
      <div class="arch-title">topic_explorer.py + explorer_extensions.py</div>
      <div class="arch-file">📄 ~900 + 160 líneas</div>
      <div class="arch-desc"><strong>TopicExplorer</strong>: pipeline en una sola pasada sobre un corpus pre-cargado. <strong>explorer_extensions.py</strong>: subclases (<code>RelationAwareExplorer</code>, <code>PathAwareExplorer</code>, <code>HybridExplorer</code>) que conectan cada encoder con el pipeline.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="arch-card">
      <div class="arch-badge badge-corp">Corpus</div>
      <div class="arch-title">curlie_corpus.py + paper_corpus.py</div>
      <div class="arch-file">📄 ~360 + 250 líneas</div>
      <div class="arch-desc">Loaders de corpus. <strong>CurlieCorpus</strong>: carga archivos TSV del directorio de Curlie con filtros de categoría. <strong>PaperDatasetCorpus</strong>: corpus del paper ODP/Curlie, con caché pickle. Ambos exponen la misma interfaz.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="sec" id="ov-pipelines">
  <div class="sec-title"><span class="icon">🔄</span> Pipeline — TopicExplorer</div>

  <div class="sec-subtitle">Pasos del pipeline</div>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num"><div class="step-circle">1</div><div class="step-line"></div></div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <div class="step-title">Cargar corpus</div>
        <div class="step-desc"><code>CurlieCorpus</code> o <code>PaperDatasetCorpus</code> carga todos los documentos del directorio de datos, aplica filtros de categoría y deduplica por URL.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num"><div class="step-circle">2</div><div class="step-line"></div></div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <div class="step-title">Embeddings del corpus (con caché)</div>
        <div class="step-desc"><code>_get_corpus_embeddings()</code> — embeddea todo el corpus con SBERT (all-MiniLM-L6-v2, 384 dim). El resultado se guarda como <code>.npz</code> en disco y se reutiliza. La clave del caché incluye número de entradas e include_keywords para invalidación automática.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num"><div class="step-circle">3</div><div class="step-line"></div></div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <div class="step-title">Encoder del mapa</div>
        <div class="step-desc">El mapa conceptual se codifica en un centroide + N aspect vectors según la estrategia elegida (<code>node_label</code>, <code>relation_aware</code>, <code>path_aware</code>, <code>hybrid</code>). Cada encoder está implementado en <code>concept_map_encoder.py</code>.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num"><div class="step-circle">4</div><div class="step-line"></div></div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <div class="step-title">Retrieval por similitud coseno</div>
        <div class="step-desc"><code>_retrieve_candidates()</code> — para cada aspect vector recupera los <code>top_k_per_aspect</code> documentos más similares del corpus. Un documento entra como candidato si supera dos gates: similitud con el aspect ≥ <code>min_aspect_sim</code> y similitud con el centroide ≥ <code>min_doc_relevance</code>.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num"><div class="step-circle">5</div><div class="step-line"></div></div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <div class="step-title">Gate de relevancia</div>
        <div class="step-desc"><code>_compute_map_vec_and_gate()</code> — calcula el vector del mapa (<code>_map_vec</code>) a partir de los top-30 términos ponderados, y aplica un segundo gate descartando candidatos con similitud &lt; <code>min_doc_relevance</code>. Garantiza retener al menos <code>min_cluster_size × 4</code> documentos.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num"><div class="step-circle">6</div><div class="step-line"></div></div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <div class="step-title">Clustering con BERTopic (UMAP + HDBSCAN)</div>
        <div class="step-desc"><code>_fit_bertopic()</code> — ajusta BERTopic sobre el sub-conjunto de candidatos. UMAP reduce la dimensionalidad de 384 a <code>umap_n_components</code>; HDBSCAN clusteriza. n_neighbors y n_components se adaptan automáticamente si el corpus es pequeño. Construye jerarquía de tópicos si hay ≥ 2 tópicos base.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num"><div class="step-circle">7</div><div class="step-line"></div></div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <div class="step-title">Selección del nivel óptimo del árbol</div>
        <div class="step-desc"><code>_select_level()</code> — evalúa todos los niveles del árbol jerárquico de BERTopic (de <code>min_nr_topics</code> a <code>max_nr_topics</code>). Para cada nr calcula un score combinando <strong>focus</strong> (similitud media al mapa), <strong>specificity</strong> (distribución equitativa de tamaños, vía Gini) y <strong>quality</strong> (fracción de tópicos que pasan filtros de salida). Elige el nr con mayor score total.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num"><div class="step-circle">8</div><div class="step-line"></div></div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <div class="step-title">Construcción y ranking de tópicos</div>
        <div class="step-desc"><code>_build_explored_topics()</code> calcula por cluster: centroide normalizado, coherencia (similitud media al centroide), focus_score (similitud centroide–mapa), keywords con TF-IDF, documentos ordenados por similitud. <code>_rank_topics()</code> filtra por coherencia, focus, tamaño y categoría; puntúa con overlap ponderado de términos del mapa.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

